NAME: user label named like an old generated label
DESCRIPTION: the user's (label LET1) is distinct from the generated _LET1; fixed in i-7d2612-425c66, see behtests/label_collision.beh
SRC:
(let (x 7)
  (seq
    (JMP LET1)
    (DAT (store x) 0)
    (label LET1)
    (JMP (Dir 0)) ))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

  JMP    $LET1  , #0     
_LET1 
  DAT    #7     , #0     
LET1  
  JMP    $0     , #0     
  DAT    #0     , #0     